{"reference":["List every recorded lease with owner liveness, age, expiry, machine, resource","identity, and description. --json is always complete. AXI defaults to 100","compact rows and 500-character text previews; --full shows all fields, records,","text and matching leases. Counts and --full hints identify truncated output.","Aliases: ls, ps, who. No arguments shows the live home view.","Examples:","  berth ps","  berth who --owner pid:1234 --json","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or BERTH_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","berth job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;","75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Berth's own 1/2 apply only when no child","was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait","failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.","76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).","Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure."],"usage":"berth list [--owner KIND:ID] [--machine NAME] [--full] [--axi | --json]"}
